---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="About me and my work.">
  <div class="about-content">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I'm Dimitris Pantazis, a software developer from Greece. My non-greek friends and coworkers call me <strong>Dimi</strong>.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Origin Story</h2>
      <p>
        I've started my professional journey in the world of software development in 2018. My first touch with code though was in 2008 when i was 14 years old and i was playing DOTA (Defense of the Ancients) in Warcraft 3.
      </p>
      <p>
        Back then, various bots were created by the community and i was one of those people for whom the bots weren't doing exactly what i wanted them to... So i had to see their code and understand how they worked!
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I Do</h2>
      <p>
        Nowadays, I'm working as a Senior Software Engineer at <a href="https://stellarworks.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">StellarWP</a>, where i help maintain and
        build new features for <a href="https://theeventscalendar.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Events Calendar</a> products and various other StellarWP products.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also do work on other projects through my agency <a href="https://pantadev.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Panta Dev</a>! If you're interested in working with me, feel free to <a href="mailto:dimi@pantadev.com">reach out</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Expertise</h2>
      <p>
        My expertise lies in helping businesses of any size, from startups to enterprise, with their needs. That doesn't have to be a WordPress project necessarily, since
        I am experienced in working with a variety of technologies and frameworks.
      </p>
      <div class="tech-list">
        <span>Laravel</span>
        <span>Symfony</span>
        <span>React</span>
        <span>Next.js</span>
        <span>Vue</span>
        <span>Express</span>
        <span>NestJS</span>
        <span>WordPress</span>
        <span>WooCommerce</span>
      </div>
      <p>
        I have worked extensively with WordPress, both as a developer and as a consultant, with a deep understanding of the ecosystem including WooCommerce, The Events Calendar, Event Tickets, LearnDash, and more.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Philosophy</h2>
      <p>
        I am a big advocate of well tested and documented code. I believe that code should be easy to understand, easy to maintain and safe to update. Without surprises.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
